<title>FRANCE: Canalsatellite subscribers hit 500,000.</title>
<headline>Canalsatellite subscribers hit 500,000.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canalsatellite said on Thursday its number of subscribers would hit the 500,000 mark this weekend, including more than 300,000 homes that have opted for digital service.</p>
<p>Canalsatellite said in a statement the results of the past few months had been particularly successful with more than 150,000 digital terminals installed in subscriber homes since December 1, 1996.</p>
<p>(( -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 ))</p>
</text>
